{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57813","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57813","key":"SV-11320","fields":{"summary":"Tech View: drag grip on every row and technician header (none on Unassigned header)","description":"h3. What\n\nShow the design's six-dot drag grip at the left of every Tech View work order row, Unassigned's rows included, for users who can drag work orders.\n\nAlready right on staging and not part of this ticket (Chris Ward, answer 16, 15 Oct 2026): technician group headers show the grip, the Unassigned header shows none, and a view-only user sees no row grips.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS9-R1a (v53): \"In Tech View every work order row, Unassigned's rows included, shows the design's six-dot drag grip at its left edge to users who can drag work orders (S4-N1). Every technician group header shows the grip to every user who can reorder technicians (S9-R2), view-only users included, because the technician order is personal. The Unassigned group header shows no grip, because Unassigned cannot move (S9-R8). The whole row still drags (S2-R8); the grip shows that it can.\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v58|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026) (S9-R1a, unchanged since v53).\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nRows show no grip, although dragging a row works.\n\n* Still the same on staging {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}}, 16 Oct 2026: no work order row shows a grip, in Unassigned or in a technician's group (test C590116).\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* A user with Work Orders create and edit sees a grip on every work order row, Unassigned's rows included.\n* A view-only user sees no row grips.\n* Dragging from anywhere on the row still works; a click still opens the work order.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\nh3. PRD v54 update (2026-10-15)\n\n* S9-R1a reworded per grip (v53): row grips follow who can drag work orders (S4-N1); every technician group header shows the grip to everyone who can reorder technicians (S9-R2), view-only users included; the Unassigned header has no grip because Unassigned cannot move (S9-R8).\n\n----\n\n*Test cases for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590116|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590116] Six-dot grips on Tech View rows and technician headers, none on Unassigned\n* [C590117|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590117] Tech View group headers show grip, arrow, avatar, name and count as designed","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57813/comment/78733","id":"78733","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:b2d16ade-9013-4875-8a9d-e255e63e8217] [~accountid:712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e] for QA: please test this against PRD 